  "final": {
    "agentMessage": "Renewing Vehicle Registration - In-Person / At Office - California DMV Service Advisor result for \"renew vehicle registration at DMV office\":\n\n**Option 1 - Renew Online (preferred):**\n> \"In most cases, vehicle registration renewal is no longer processed at the DMV office and can be completed quickly and easily online, saving you time and postage.\"\n* `Renew Online` button\n* If you are unable to renew through simple online application, you can renew online using the `assisted virtual renewal service.`\n\n**Instead of online - office-related options:**\n\n**Option 2 - DMV Kiosks:**\n> \"DMV Kiosks use touchscreen technology to guide you through renewing your registration. DMV Kiosks are available inside select DMV offices and retail locations during regular business hours.\"\n* Link: `Find a kiosk near you.`\n\n**Option 3 - By mail:**\n> \"Renew by mail to the address on your renewal letter.\"\n\n**Option 4 - By phone:**\n> \"Renew by phone at 1-800-777-0133.\"\n\n**Option 5 - Business Partners:**\n> \"Vehicle registration renewals, duplicate sticker orders, and title transfers can be completed with DMV, or with DMV business partners and auto clubs. Business partners are authorized to charge a fee for their services.\"\n* Link: `Find a Business Partner Location`\n\n**Option 6 - In-person when required - How to save time:**\n> \"There are cases that require renewal in person, such as eligibility, restrictions, etc. In these cases, you may schedule an appointment to renew at the DMV office.\"\n* `I am ready to visit the office today.` -> `Get in Line Now` button\n* `I need an appointment in the future.` -> `Make an appointment for registration renewal.` link\n* \"Your current registration card and sticker may be used until your new registration card and sticker are received. Select `Check Registration Status` for the latest information.\"\n\nTo save time on office visit: use Kiosk inside office if eligible, use Get in Line Now if going today, or Make an appointment for future, and Check Registration Status online."
